{"c":[{"id":"f47ceea4c51ec6383ddeaae45ef7b734211a1b1b572530596b6750c6578d16ee","sum":"Wake/recall/zoom share xN TOKEN: body; leaves are x1 YYYY-MM-DD: no parens; packs have no day; recall matches note text and captions; fold_request Run: adds --path REL when walk-up from $PWD would miss the store.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"15146632137cf43021d489f9e4f48ee9b6d6e2a642322ff1169f9cb7034287ee","sum":"fold_request Run: adds --path REL when walk-up from $PWD would miss the store; wake dates leaves x1 YYYY-MM-DD: from the stamp, packs stay xN prefix: caption.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260823T212302Z-619f7114a3c3445b","text":"fold_request Run: includes --path REL when walk-up from $PWD would not select the folded store.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260824T142559Z-853c6c0b6ec510e9","text":"Wake leaf lines are x1 (YYYY-MM-DD): text from the filename stamp; nap lines stay xN prefix: caption with no day.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"87f86d77a75e48416070f802db542dbcccc25c89d62f37f501be26d054792939","sum":"Wake/recall/zoom share xN TOKEN: body; leaves are x1 YYYY-MM-DD: with no parens; recall matches note text and nap captions, not grain, day, or id prefix.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260824T143849Z-bb7956f2f4651e25","text":"Wake leaf line is x1 YYYY-MM-DD: text, no parens; same xN TOKEN: body grammar as a pack.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260824T163806Z-5d0f4e137b683d7f","text":"Zoom and recall print the same wake grammar as wake (dated leaves, unique-prefix packs); recall matches note text and nap captions, not grain, day, or id prefix.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"9f77cab1df115c25d8e0746a384deb1be0e3f36eac8973662b5f6e162a1312f1","sum":"Wake/recall/zoom share format_wake_line and enqueue NapChild ids from the tree; 3.11 floor is immediately after import sys; named_ids catches _TREE_PARSE_ERRORS including AttributeError; agent-display-unify is PR #37.","tree":{"c":[{"id":"38ea7198a36885685cc2ea905e2a543f4ae276b8b1741dd00430fea553a10713","sum":"Wake/recall/zoom share format_wake_line; proof walkers enqueue NapChild ids from the children tree, not zoom stdout; agent-display-unify archived as PR #37.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260824T165407Z-a27fb3a92805a5d6","text":"Recall and zoom print format_wake_line like wake; proof walkers enqueue NapChild ids from the children tree, not zoom stdout tokens.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260824T173019Z-27bced2c4e108fab","text":"agent-display-unify archived: wake/recall/zoom share format_wake_line; PR #37 on labelling.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"},{"id":"1fcbcf0346304c1f1707b91c5dfef6a1949cb0638783cfa2e283e8e02afca8f9","sum":"3.11 floor is immediately after import sys so 3.10 prints SumMem needs Python 3.11 or newer; named_ids catches _TREE_PARSE_ERRORS including AttributeError on a non-mapping child.","tree":{"c":[{"name":"20260824T174425Z-833402129b2e4377","text":"require_python in main() is too late: module-level import tomllib dies on Python 3.10 before SumMem needs Python 3.11 or newer.","type":"note"},{"name":"20260824T174736Z-d428af9e8413115e","text":"named_ids catches _TREE_PARSE_ERRORS like the other tree readers, including AttributeError when a children-file child is not a mapping.","type":"note"}]},"type":"nap"}]},"type":"nap"}]}
